  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_5034.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jVuDKpBKv3Y\" target=\"_blank\">L&#39;associaci&oacute; Onda Centre Comercial (OCC)</a> ha celebrat aquest dimecres 5 de desembre el seu <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QUtDKz-pXao\" target=\"_blank\">sopar anual, als salons Princesa</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_5043.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Saray T&iacute;o Palomar li ha donat una placa a Juan Lizondo Lengua i Javier Mu&ntilde;oz Jim&eacute;nez a Patricia Chiva Moliner. La nova directiva agraeix aix&iacute; el treball d&#39;anteriors components. S&#39;han sortejat dos cap de setmana a l&#39;hotel Balfag&oacute;n de Cantavieja, que han sigut per a Hermanos Monferrer i per a Lencer&iacute;a Mari&aacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5016.jpg\" alt=\"img_5016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5018.jpg\" alt=\"img_5018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5019.jpg\" alt=\"img_5019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5021.jpg\" alt=\"img_5021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5023.jpg\" alt=\"img_5023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparondacentrecomercial18/img_5025.jpg\" alt=\"img_5025\"